            "documentation": "**Divider** · A line between parts of the content. A CSS component with one class and no JavaScript.\n\n`data-variant`: subtle, strong (default without the attribute)\n\n[Documentation](https://lo-tek.sobernetics.no/components/divider/)",
            "start": 15,
            "end": 21
          },
          {
            "label": "lt-button",
            "kind": "class",
            "detail": "Button",
            "start": 15,
            "end": 21
